    "title": "Dunzo Logistics is Hiring: Warehouse Manager (Lead)",
    "description": "Dunzo Logistics is actively seeking a talented and motivated Warehouse Manager to join our dynamic team in Aurangabad. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Dunzo Logistics:\nDunzo Logistics is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Prepare MIS reports on delivery performance and SLA adherence\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Handle customs clearance for import and export shipments\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBBS / MD / MS from recognized medical college\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in SAP SCM\n• Proficiency in Fleet Management\n• Proficiency in Reverse Logistics\n• Proficiency in Cold Chain Logistics\n• Proficiency in Customs Clearance\n• Proficiency in 3PL Management\n• Proficiency in WMS\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Aurangabad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Dunzo Logistics!",
